## Actions

console-effects-view-session = Open session
console-effects-view-agent = Open agent
console-effects-view-connect = Connect an agent
console-effects-stop-agent = Stop agent
console-effects-undo-agent-session = Undo agent session
console-effects-take-over-agent = Take over
console-effects-revoke-agent = Revoke agent
console-view = Agent sessions shown
console-view-show-everything = Show all sessions
